Build an integrated institutional complaint management and intelligence platform that enables authorized administrators to register, classify, assign, monitor, investigate, escalate, resolve, and analyze institution-related complaints across different AICTE bureaus and cells.

The application must solve the actual operational problem of fragmented complaint tracking, delayed responses, limited visibility, duplicate complaints, weak interdepartmental coordination, poor escalation monitoring, and the absence of a consolidated management dashboard.

Do not create a generic complaint registration website.

